; ACTTAB - action keys (arrows/Home/End/PgUp/PgDn).
;------------------------------------------------------------
ACTTAB:
        DB      ACT_CURLT
        DW      VC_H
        DB      ACT_CURRT
        DW      VC_L
        DB      ACT_CURDN
        DW      VC_J
